sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant QP as Questrade Portal
    participant UI as Setup UI (Frontend)
    participant PS as Python Script (TokenManager)
    participant KC as macOS Keychain
    participant CF as .questrade_cache

    Note over U, QP: Phase 1: Manual Seeding
    U->>QP: Generate Manual Refresh Token
    QP-->>U: Return 1-week Token
    U->>UI: Paste Token into Modal
    UI->>PS: Initialize Cache with Seed Token

    Note over PS, KC: Phase 2: Secure Encryption (ADR 019)
    PS->>KC: keyring.get_password("InvestmentToolkit", "QuestradeMasterKey")
    
    alt Key not found (First Run)
        PS->>PS: Generate 256-bit AES Master Key
        PS->>KC: keyring.set_password(...)
        Note right of KC: Key stored in hardware security
    else Key exists
        KC-->>PS: Return hex-encoded Master Key
    end

    PS->>PS: Encrypt tokens with AES-GCM (Nonce + Ciphertext)
    
    rect rgb(200, 230, 255)
    Note right of PS: Phase 3: Atomic Storage (ADR 015)
    PS->>CF: Write encrypted refresh token to .questrade_cache.tmp
    PS->>CF: os.replace(.tmp, .cache)
    Note right of CF: Validated write complete (Persistence)
    end
    
    Note over CF: Only binary noise visible locally
